    {
      "id": "1e374373-4ffb-5a02-a483-1736235d623c",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "오늘 훈련, 솔직히 좀 빡셌어요.\n그래도 뭔가 감이 오는 것 같기도 하고요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Today's training was rough, honestly.\nBut I think I'm starting to get a feel for it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "210d98fd-3f1e-5621-84cd-fd2080753a8a",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "이야기 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "1e374373-4ffb-5a02-a483-1736235d623c"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "c460736d-54aa-5d81-bc0c-4dced6c069e6": "story",
        "2ffa9cd8-a431-5fe0-9459-0df49cfed610": -1,
        "0bc8c3af-fb34-5eac-a8c0-651856f691c2": 0,
        "bc5747fd-b87a-5da4-94ee-9b8822d35f68": "",
        "2118faf5-c657-55b7-9c48-074f8c51a2b1": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "48b8f2d2-1ce4-525f-9ff4-2c705ea91347",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "b3ee9fac-9948-58f1-8117-8413c3b795a6",
          "text": "감이 올 때 한 번 더 밀어붙이자. 내가 봐 줄게.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "bfca0688-32eb-5672-bc4d-478a1e17ca6b": "train_bonus:std;stress:+8;awaken:+5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1307f70a-6f1e-5527-872f-66c3fc28f8b3",
          "text": "오늘은 여기까지. 푹 쉬면서 정리하자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "bfca0688-32eb-5672-bc4d-478a1e17ca6b": "stress_train:-2;trust:+2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0676d8cc-f1b5-5133-8879-06cc481b7107",
          "text": "잘했어. 그 감각 잊지 마.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "bfca0688-32eb-5672-bc4d-478a1e17ca6b": "ok>trust:+3;ok>awaken:+8;ng>trust:+1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:b3ee9fac-9948-58f1-8117-8413c3b795a6": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's push once more while it clicks. I'll watch.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:1307f70a-6f1e-5527-872f-66c3fc28f8b3": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "That's enough for today. Rest and let it settle.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:0676d8cc-f1b5-5133-8879-06cc481b7107": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Good work. Don't lose that feeling.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4c9f27a6-a4b2-5a14-9c85-690ab2175cd8",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…좋아요, 한 번 더 해 볼게요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…Okay, one more go!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9a25359b-6883-5d9c-b6b1-37c72c93d338",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "정말요? 감사합니다, 감독님.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Really? Thank you, Coach.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "51a492a3-ab4e-582a-9a62-c99c442554a4",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네! 꼭 기억할게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Yes! I'll remember it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "e1c30329-22fd-505c-b683-918bfdbfc4da": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28c6a125-57a9-52a9-8210-894e7e0896e2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…네, 노력해 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…Okay, I'll try.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "e1c30329-22fd-505c-b683-918bfdbfc4da": "ng"
      }
    }
